@aspect_evidence_status:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by their evidential or assumption-bearing status rather than by runtime component identity alone.
@aspect_evidence_status:inclusion text
Include KUs that justify a method, expose assumptions, preserve uncertainty, or provide decision rationale.
@aspect_evidence_status:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that only name a method or decision without explaining why it matters.
@aspect_evidence_status:protocol text
Prefer KUs that explicitly preserve what is known, what is assumed, and what remains uncertain for the current request.
@aspect_evidence_status:role_vocabulary json
["evidence note", "assumption note", "method note"]
@aspect_evidence_status:query_terms json
["evidence", "assumption", "uncertainty", "method", "benchmark", "decision"]
